A. Model Performance1. 
Which pre-trained model achieved the highest accuracy? Why?
ResNet50 achieved the highest test accuracy ($77.34\%$).
Why: Its skip-connections (residual blocks) allow it to train much deeper architectures effectively 
without suffering from the vanishing gradient problem. This enables the model to extract highly complex, 
hierarchical spatial features from the bonsai images compared to VGG16's shallower, sequential structure.

